  (text "PCIe lane 0" (at 125.73 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 630b3db5-a4e3-56db-a375-23a1141c9de4))
  (text "Host-to-card pair (PCIE_TX_P/N) and REFCLK connect J1 to J2 directly.\nThe card has no AC coupling on its transmitter, so the card-to-host pair\ngets 220 nF here, within 12.5 mm of the socket (SD Express host guideline).\nPolarity is preserved on all three pairs." (at 127 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 657b0449-5b07-50f9-ae78-6f4a7cbf21a9))
