  (text "Sideband and legacy SD pins" (at 125.73 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d8e370be-b421-5166-9987-b243010c6bff))
  (text "PERST#/CLKREQ# go straight through 0R links (place for series R or a translator).\nCMD and CLK must not float in PCIe mode: CMD is pulled up, CLK is held low so no\nstray edge can switch the card to SD mode. R3 is fitted only if the host has no\nCLKREQ# pull-up. R9 grounds M.2 pin 73 like every legacy (3.3 V sideband) module." (at 127 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid be6b6ce0-9a5b-5411-9b20-af6064ae4ffc))
