  (text "1.8 V supply for VDD2 (TLV62568, 1 A buck)" (at 125.73 176.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9adad767-f048-54fb-8ff0-f522b6025cbd))
  (text "Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R7/R8) = 1.80 V.  R6/C6 delay EN about 8 ms so VDD2 rises after VDD1,\nwhich is what puts the card into PCIe mode.  Sustained card load 0.4 A, peak 0.6 A." (at 127 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid acc44a5b-5f3b-5954-af70-7e29d4b424bd))
